* bitflag-heavy.cos — an ATTR-bitflag-rich script for showcasing inlay
* hints (plan/05-hover-and-inlay-hints.md). Each ATTR line below sets a
* different combination of bits; hovering/inspecting each should render a
* "(Name,Name,...)" pill matching vs-caos-editor's own output for the same
* file/variant.

scrp 2 1 1000 0
attr 0
attr 1
attr 2
attr 3
attr 4
attr 5
attr 6
attr 7
attr 8
attr 16
attr 512
attr 517
endm
